&oe=69B54C95"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Banana Game!", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf4c Banana Game \u2013 A Gorilla Tag Fan Game\nWelcome to Banana Game, a chaotic, high-energy VR experience where you run, jump, and climb just like a monkey\u2014no joysticks, just pure movement! Inspired by Gorilla Tag, this fan-made game takes everything you love and throws in a big pile of bananas, new maps, game modes, and a wild community.\n\nClimb walls, swing through trees, and dodge slippery banana traps as you chase or escape your friends in fast-paced tag matches. Customize your monkey, unlock silly cosmetics, and explore jungles, cities, and banana-themed madness.\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Movement-based locomotion\n\ud83c\udf4c Banana traps and power-ups\n\ud83c\udf10 Multiplayer chaos\n\ud83c\udfad Cosmetic customization\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Unique, community-inspired maps\n\nNo rules. No limits. Just monkey business.\nCan you become the top banana?", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf4c Banana Game \u2013 A Gorilla Tag Fan Game\n\nClimb walls, swing through trees, and dodge slippery banana traps as you chase or escape your friends in fast-paced tag matches. Customize your monkey, unlock sill"}]}, "developer_name": "MayhemLLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/10LZnuwhqBHZHpjVe02BDMyLzWdFnv7wOBcf5jeHVVxw/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nightmare", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scary-chubz/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": nul